new file mode 100644
index 0000000..65de23c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/demos/win.dem
@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+# win.dem — Story 1.4: the thinnest WIN. The 1.2 fixture (residential(0) ←
+# router(1) → content_host(2)); draw the full source→router→sink path; spawn one
+# packet residential(0) → content_host(2). It flows per-hop (bandwidth 30 vs
+# standard cap 15 → 2 ticks/edge) and delivers at the sink at tick 46 (2300ms):
+#   t41 spawn (forward onto edge0) · t42 mid edge0 · t43 arrive router ·
+#   t44 forward onto edge1 · t45 mid edge1 · t46 ARRIVE sink → score 1.
+# win goal 1 → score(1) ≥ goal(1) at tick 46 → Run_Won (terminal). The capture
+# at 2300ms pins the terminal/win frame (T1 hash carries score+outcome+Run_Won;
+# T2 pixel the settled topology). run 3000ms lets a few post-terminal ticks
+# exercise the barrier (frozen hashes) in the manifest.
+seed 42
+run 3000ms
+at 500ms draw 0 1 standard
+at 1500ms draw 1 2 standard
+at 2050ms spawn 0 2
+win goal 1
+capture at 2300ms
+expect hash stable
